{"kind":"cas-record-v1","metadata":{"entries":[{"origin_package":"github.com/codalotl/codalotl/internal/agentbuilder","target_package":"github.com/codalotl/codalotl/internal/lints","identifier":"Run","question":"When Run renders a custom Step command, which template fields expose targetPkgAbsDir or its sandbox-relative package path? I need a black-box test that records the target directory passed to Run.","answer":"Use these templates in a custom `Step` command:\n\n- `{{ .path }}`: the absolute `targetPkgAbsDir` passed to `Run`. It is registered as `InputTypePathDir`, so cmdrunner validates it and supplies an absolute path.\n- `{{ .rootDir }}`: the `sandboxDir` passed to `Run`.\n- `{{ relativeTo .path .rootDir }}`: computes the package path relative to the sandbox. There is no dedicated sandbox-relative package field.\n- `{{ .relativePackageDir }}`: package path relative to the discovered Go module directory, not necessarily relative to the sandbox.\n- `{{ .moduleDir }}`: absolute directory containing the relevant `go.mod`.\n\nFor a black-box recorder command:\n\n```go\nstep := lints.Step{\n\tID:         \"record-target\",\n\tSituations: []lints.Situation{lints.SituationTests},\n\tCheck: \u0026cmdrunner.Command{\n\t\tCommand: recorderExecutable,\n\t\tArgs: []string{\n\t\t\t\"{{ .path }}\",\n\t\t\t\"{{ relativeTo .path .rootDir }}\",\n\t\t},\n\t},\n}\n\n_, err := lints.Run(\n\tcontext.Background(),\n\tsandboxDir,\n\ttargetPkgAbsDir,\n\t[]lints.Step{step},\n\tlints.SituationTests,\n)\n```\n\nThe recorder receives the absolute target as its first argument and the sandbox-relative path as its second. If your test places `go.mod` directly in `sandboxDir`, then `{{ .relativePackageDir }}` will also normally equal the sandbox-relative path, but that equivalence should not be relied upon when the module is nested.\n\nThese inputs are supplied to both `Active` commands and the selected `Check`/`Fix` command (`internal/lints/lints.go:729-733`, `internal/lints/lints.go:766-768`, `internal/lints/lints.go:783-799`)."}]},"additional_info":{"unix_timestamp":1784225627,"paths":["internal/lints/SPEC.md","internal/lints/doc.go","internal/lints/lints.go","internal/lints/lints_test.go"],"git_clean":false,"git_commit":"cb7ee5e564c06d3136dfefee05effd92f317ad88","git_merge_base":"4bc7dae434de30b02c38e42feb254065d3020f3f"}}